<title>UK: Credit Lyonnais warrants on Consumer Sector basket.</title>
<headline>Credit Lyonnais warrants on Consumer Sector basket.</headline>
<dateline>LONDON 1996-10-14</dateline>
<text>
<p>Credit Lyonnais Financial Products (Guernsey) Ltd has issued 100 million American-style call warrants, on a basket of consumer sector stocks comprising Giordano International, Goldlion Holdings, Guangnan Holdings, Ng Fung Hong, Tingyi, lead manager Credit Lyonnais said.</p>
<p>10 warrant control one reference basket.  STRIKE PRICE    20.835 HKD		PREMIUM	9.8 PCT</p>
<p> ISSUE PRICE     0.6209 HKD		GEARING	3.36 TIMES</p>
<p> MATURITY DATE   14.OCT.97		 PAYDATE	28.OCT.96</p>
<p> LISTING	   HONG KONG		 MIN EXER LOT 40000</p>
<p> SPOT REFERENCE  20.835 HKD</p>
<p>--Reuter London Newsroom +44 171 542 7658</p>
</text>
